  "limitations": [
    "Classifies taxing power only; does not calculate gross pension, withholding, IRPEF, Spanish IRPF, foreign tax credit, net income, refunds or full tax return outcomes.",
    "Requires explicit fiscal residence, nationality when Article 19 exception may apply, payer country and public/private service nature.",
    "Hybrid entities, special social-security agreements, professional funds with uncertain status and optional resident regimes require human review."
